Third-party material shipped in this repository keeps its own licence. The full list, with
authors, licences and links, is in THIRD_PARTY.md (fonts, data, tools) and
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md (Rust crates). In short:

  * Shinonome 12 dot fonts (assets/fonts/shnmk12.bdf, shnm6x12r.bdf): public domain.
  * M+ bitmap fonts (assets/fonts/mplus_*.bdf, src/generated/mplus_f12r.rs): M+ FONTS
    licence (free, unlimited use/copy/distribution; text in assets/fonts/MPlus-LICENSE.txt).
  * ChiKareGo2 by Giles Booth (assets/fonts/ChiKareGo2.fnt): Creative Commons Attribution,
    converted to another file format by tools/gen_chikarego.py (this is an adaptation).
  * World map: Natural Earth 110m land, public domain.
  * Time zones: the IANA tz database through the chrono-tz crate.
  * Input method (src/ime/): original code, no third-party input-method code or tables. No dictionary is included
