    chooses to download at install time (Mozc OSS dictionary, Google, BSD-3-Clause; the data carries the NAIST/IPAdic,
    ICOT and Okinawa dictionary terms). It is converted on the device and its licence text is
    assets/ime/Mozc-LICENSE.txt (verbatim). Details in THIRD_PARTY.md ("Input method").

